<title>JAPAN: Nissho Iwai set terms for 5 bln yen 2.1 pct bonds.</title>
<headline>Nissho Iwai set terms for 5 bln yen 2.1 pct bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Nissho Iwai Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Sanwa Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>FISCAL AGENT - Sanwa Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE		     ISSUE NO   9	  AMT   five bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON   2.1 pct     ISS PRICE 98.96 yen MATURITY 10.Jul.03</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 10.Jul.97  INT PAY 10. Jan/Jul</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI  A	  LAST NIS   A</p>
<p>NOTE - The bonds will be able to be redeemed earlier on July 10, 2000.</p>
</text>
